t tickets in exchanging and replacing hardware components in a cloud engineering center\n- Completing different introduction tours to different hardware components and how to replace them\n", "short_description": "The VR4VET Cloud Engineering VR app simulates a cloud engineering workplace with different tasks to be performed in cloud engineering centre. The users can experience situations representing typical workplaces in a data and cloud engineering center, such as setting up tickets, selecting and replacing hardware components in different server cabinets."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vr4vet.eu/cloud-engineering/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Norwegian University of Science and Technology", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vr4vet.eu/cloud-engineering/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26988742780713647"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311611_851163407282883_264403321586698744_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6V5rglmjqzYQ7kNvwFPGEUR&_nc_oc=AdqTB8AGxgkFJEwu2zRglrdMSrz6N2EKMTq9KLWgO__0t_-M1UF7r9wjtfgKRI9WpqA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9QuqnFCF1VM3gGZC1O_Co1o_5_hhSZg5s1Yf4cZryjzA&oe=6A47DD0C"}, "is_conce